---
config:
  theme: base
  htmlLabels: true
  forceLegacyMathML: true
  layout: elk
  fontFamily: "CMU Serif, Latin Modern Roman, serif"
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 16
    rankSpacing: 24
    padding: 12
    curve: linear
    wrappingWidth: 320
  themeVariables:
    background: "#ffffff"
    fontFamily: "CMU Serif, Latin Modern Roman, serif"
    fontSize: "24px"
    primaryTextColor: "#17202A"
    edgeLabelBackground: "#ffffff"
    clusterBkg: "#fafafa"
    clusterBorder: "#737373"
    lineColor: "#475569"
  themeCSS: |
    .nodeLabel { font-family: "CMU Serif", "Latin Modern Roman", serif; font-size: 24px; }
    .nodeLabel div { flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.2; }
    .nodeLabel b { display: block; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .edgeLabel { font-family: "CMU Serif", "Latin Modern Roman", serif; font-size: 22px; }
    .cluster-label { font-family: "CMU Serif", "Latin Modern Roman", serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
    .katex { font-size: 1em; }
    .katex-display { margin: 0; }
---
flowchart TB
  %% aria-notation: typst
  %% aria-architecture: symbolic-computational
  %% aria-width-mm: 160
  accTitle: Selected transition and supported Double-Q backup
  accDescr: The pose-only Step updates pose, prefix, budget and candidates without fabricating an actor observation. The selected gain comes from privileged oracle measurement. Successor support intersects hard feasibility with horizon-specific label support. The piecewise bootstrap separates online selection from delayed evaluation and is zero for h=1, termination or empty support. Current-state all-candidate labels are not successor values.
  State["<b>Actor</b>$$#symb.rl.s_pose$$"]:::input
  Step["<b>Selected transition</b>$$#eqs.rl.replay_transition$$"]:::compute
  Oracle["<b>Oracle</b>$$#symb.rl.s_oracle$$"]:::input
  Reward["<b>Reward</b>$$#eqs.rl.target_root_gain_reward$$"]:::compute
  Support["<b>Successor support</b>$$#eqs.rl.qh_supported_successor_set$$"]:::compute
  Backup["<b>Double-Q</b>$$#eqs.rl.qh_doubleq_index$$"]:::compute
  Target["<b>Target</b>$$#eqs.rl.qh_doubleq_target$$"]:::compute
  State --> Step
  Step --> Support
  Step --> Reward
  Oracle --> Reward
  Support --> Backup
  Reward --> Target
  Backup --> Target

  classDef input fill:#D5E8D4,stroke:#82B366,color:#17202A,stroke-width:1.5px,rx:0,ry:0;
  classDef output fill:#F8CECC,stroke:#B85450,color:#17202A,stroke-width:1.5px,rx:0,ry:0;
  classDef compute fill:#E1D5E7,stroke:#9673A6,color:#17202A,stroke-width:1.5px,rx:8,ry:8;
  classDef data fill:#F5F5F5,stroke:#9E9E9E,color:#17202A,stroke-width:1.2px,rx:0,ry:0;
  classDef status fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#475569,color:#17202A,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:5 4,rx:0,ry:0;
